---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | RoamDawn" description="RoamDawn privacy policy covering contact forms, affiliate links, advertising, cookies, third-party services and user rights.">
<section class="container max-w-4xl policy-page">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="updated"><strong>Last updated: August 25, 2026</strong></p>
<p>This Privacy Policy explains how RoamDawn handles information when you visit and use this website.</p>
<h2>Information we may receive</h2><p>If you contact us, we may receive the information you choose to provide, such as your name, email address and message. Our hosting and security providers may also process technical information required to deliver and protect the website.</p>
<h2>Contact messages</h2><p>Messages sent through our Contact page are intended for <a href="mailto:contact@roamdawn.info">contact@roamdawn.info</a>. We use information you provide to respond to your request and do not sell contact information.</p>
<h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>RoamDawn may publish affiliate links from travel companies, booking platforms and other third-party services. If you click an affiliate link and make a qualifying purchase or booking, RoamDawn may receive a commission at no additional cost to you. The third party may use cookies or similar technologies on its own website to attribute referrals and commissions. Those technologies are controlled by the third party, not by RoamDawn.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2><p>RoamDawn may display advertising from Google AdSense or other advertising providers in the future. When advertising is enabled, those providers may use cookies, local storage, device information, IP address or similar technologies for advertising, measurement, fraud prevention or frequency management, subject to their policies and applicable law.</p>
<p>Before advertising services that require consent are enabled, RoamDawn will provide the disclosures and consent mechanism required for the relevant visitors and jurisdictions.</p>
<h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2><p>RoamDawn does not currently set cookies for its own analytics or behavioral advertising. However, third-party services such as advertising providers, affiliate networks or embedded content may use cookies or similar technologies when enabled. See our <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a> for more information.</p>
<h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Affiliate networks, advertisers, hosting providers, email services and other third parties may process information under their own privacy policies. When you leave RoamDawn through an external link, the external site's policies and terms apply.</p>
<h2>Data retention and security</h2><p>We retain submitted information only for as long as reasonably necessary to respond to requests, operate the site, comply with legal obligations or protect our rights. No method of internet transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights concerning access, correction, deletion, objection, restriction or portability of your personal information. Contact us to make a privacy request.</p>
<h2>International visitors</h2><p>RoamDawn may be accessed from countries with different privacy laws. Where applicable, we will respect mandatory requirements that apply to our processing activities and visitors.</p>
<h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>We may update this policy when the website, services or applicable requirements change. The date above indicates the latest update.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests, visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> or email <a href="mailto:contact@roamdawn.info">contact@roamdawn.info</a>.</p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
